; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 신명 태명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 신명 태명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">-&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 신명 태명조\">출연 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 신명 태명조\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 신명 태명조\">한국 청년 배우 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 신명 태명조\">9</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 신명 태명조\">명 및 프랑스 청년 배우 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 신명 태명조\">9</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 신명 태명조\">명</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 신명 태명조\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 신명 태명조\">총 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 신명 태명조\">18</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 신명 태명조\">명</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 신명 태명조\">)</span></p><p